1
00:00:01,126 --> 00:00:04,129
My name is Manjula Bhuyan.

2
00:00:05,004 --> 00:00:08,466
For Aadhaar card,...hmm...

3
00:00:08,466 --> 00:00:11,678
..the sarpanch of the Dambala panchayat

4
00:00:11,678 --> 00:00:16,558
