19
00:01:09,235 --> 00:01:10,487
and return (easily).

20
00:01:10,487 --> 00:01:16,910
We can go without paying any (bus) fare.

21
00:01:17,243 --> 00:01:19,579
It took a year to get (Aadhaar).

22
00:01:20,205 --> 00:01:24,501
Back then it used to take longer

23
00:01:24,501 --> 00:01:26,836
but now it's faster.

24
00:01:27,212 --> 00:01:31,800
There is (information in) other languages but not (in Juray-) Sora.

25
00:01:32,383 --> 00:01:40,225
If someone makes (information available) in Sora,

26
00:01:40,225 --> 00:01:41,976
it would be easier.

27
00:01:42,268 --> 00:01:46,606
Those who don't understand (Odia),

28
00:01:46,606 --> 00:01:48,525
